%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14c148da086a4444f9dc223cd131312a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Trainer_FirstMeeting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ProjectGame2D.Runtime::DialogueDefinition
  _dialogueId: dialogue.trainer.first_meeting
  _initialNodeId: greeting
  _nodes:
  - _nodeId: greeting
    _speakerName: Trainer
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: Ah, a new face around the training grounds. I don't believe we've been
      introduced, traveler.
    _nextNodeId: hub
    _outcomeId:
    _choices: []
  - _nodeId: hub
    _speakerName: Trainer
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: What would you like to know?
    _nextNodeId:
    _outcomeId:
    _choices:
    - _text: Who are you?
      _nextNodeId: about_trainer
    - _text: What is this place?
      _nextNodeId: about_grounds
    - _text: I'm ready to start training.
      _nextNodeId: offer
  - _nodeId: about_trainer
    _speakerName: Trainer
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: I've trained every recruit who's passed through this camp for the better
      part of twenty years. Most of them are still alive, so I must be doing
      something right.
    _nextNodeId: hub
    _outcomeId:
    _choices: []
  - _nodeId: about_grounds
    _speakerName: Trainer
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: These grounds have seen better days, but the dummies out back still
      swing hard enough to knock sense into anyone who underestimates them.
    _nextNodeId: hub
    _outcomeId:
    _choices: []
  - _nodeId: offer
    _speakerName: Trainer
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: Good. Before you head out on any adventure, you'll need a sword to
      defend yourself. Let's see if you're worth the steel.
    _nextNodeId:
    _outcomeId: trainer.greeting.offered
    _choices: []
